I have some herb fennel growing in my back garden. I used the seed heads and fronds in this wet cyanotype.

This one was made during a heatwave in August 2026, just before the partial eclipse of the sun. I arranged the materials on paper which had been coated by the photosensitive chemicals, additionally adding diluted vinegar, sea salt, soap bubbles, turmeric and coffee grounds. Then I covered the whole with clingfilm and placed under a glass cover in the sunlight. After about 90 minutes I unpacked everything and washed the paper before drying it flat.

